  "popis": {
    "cs": "Ontologie Safety performance KPIS pochází z modelu vyvořeného pro lepší kontrolu bezpečnosti v leteckém provozu v projektu LKPR. Pro ontologii byly vytvořeny mapování na ontologii UFO (https://github.com/kbss-cvut/lkpr-model/blob/main/safety-performance-kpis-ufo-mapping.ttl) a STAMP (https://github.com/kbss-cvut/lkpr-model/blob/main/safety-performance-kpis-stamp-mapping.ttl).",
    "en": "The Safety performance KPIS ontology comes from a model created for better safety control in aviation operations in the LKPR project. Mappings to the UFO (https://github.com/kbss-cvut/lkpr-model/blob/main/safety-performance-kpis-ufo-mapping.ttl) and STAMP (https://github.com/kbss-cvut/lkpr-model/blob/main/safety-performance-kpis-stamp-mapping.ttl) ontology were created for the ontology."
  },
